# Phase 2: Core Admin CRUD Pages

## Goal
Build all admin management pages for calendars, advertisements, contacts, and events. Every entity follows the same pattern.

## Build Order (by dependency)

### 1. Address Books (simplest, no deps)
- `convex/addressBooks/queries.ts` + `mutations.ts`
- `/admin/address-books` — list + create/edit dialog
- Simple name field + orgId

### 2. Calendar Editions
- `convex/calendarEditions/queries.ts` + `mutations.ts`
- `/admin/calendars` — list with columns: name, code, years active
- Create/edit dialog: name, code fields
- Soft-delete with confirmation
- Year management: add/remove active years

### 3. Advertisement Types
- `convex/advertisements/queries.ts` + `mutations.ts`
- `convex/adPricing/queries.ts` + `mutations.ts`
- `/admin/advertisements` — list with columns: name, type (day/non-day), pricing summary
- Create dialog: name, isDayType toggle
- Pricing configuration: per calendar edition per year, 12 monthly price fields
- Immutable after creation (disable edit on name/type, allow pricing updates)

### 4. Contacts / CRM
- `convex/contacts/queries.ts` + `mutations.ts`
- `/admin/contacts` — list with search (company, name, email), address book filter
- TanStack Table with sorting on all columns
- Create/edit form (multi-section):
  - Basic: company, firstName, lastName, email, phone, category, notes
  - Address: street, city, state, zip (embedded object)
  - Telecom: phone, fax, mobile (embedded object)
  - Address Books: multi-select from addressBooks
- `/admin/contacts/[id]` — detail page with tabs:
  - Info tab: all contact fields, edit button
  - Purchases tab: list of purchases (populated in Phase 3)
  - Payments tab: payment history (populated in Phase 3)
- Soft-delete: nullify email, set isDeleted, preserve history
- Full-text search via `searchText` field: create/update mutations must rebuild `searchText` as `[company, firstName, lastName, email].filter(Boolean).join(" ")`. Search index targets `searchText` (Convex only supports one searchField).

### 5. Events
- `convex/events/queries.ts` + `mutations.ts`
- `/admin/events` — list with columns: name, date, recurring badge, calendars
- Create/edit form: name, description, date, endDate (optional), startTime, endTime, isYearly toggle
- Calendar edition multi-select (associate event with editions)
- FullCalendar view as alternate to list view

## CRUD Pattern (follow for every entity)

### Convex Query — orgId from auth, NEVER from args
```typescript
export const list = query({
  args: {},
  handler: async (ctx) => {
    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();
    if (!identity) throw new Error("Not authenticated");
    const orgId = identity.orgId as string;
    if (!orgId) throw new Error("No organization selected");

    return await ctx.db
      .query("tableName")
      .withIndex("by_orgId", (q) => q.eq("orgId", orgId))
      .filter((q) => q.neq(q.field("isDeleted"), true))
      .collect();
  },
});
```

### Convex Mutation — orgId from auth, NEVER from args
```typescript
export const create = mutation({
  args: { /* fields only, no orgId */ },
  handler: async (ctx, args) => {
    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();
    if (!identity) throw new Error("Not authenticated");
    const orgId = identity.orgId as string;
    if (!orgId) throw new Error("No organization selected");

    return await ctx.db.insert("tableName", { ...args, orgId, isDeleted: false });
  },
});

export const softDelete = mutation({
  args: { id: v.id("tableName") },
  handler: async (ctx, args) => {
    const identity = await ctx.auth.getUserIdentity();
    if (!identity) throw new Error("Not authenticated");
    const orgId = identity.orgId as string;

    const doc = await ctx.db.get(args.id);
    if (!doc || doc.orgId !== orgId) throw new Error("Not found");

    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { isDeleted: true });
  },
});
```

### Page Component Structure
```
/admin/[entity]/
  page.tsx          — server component, renders client list component
  columns.tsx       — TanStack Table column definitions
  [entity]-form.tsx — React Hook Form + Zod dialog/sheet form
```

